B.samples\n-rw-rw-r--  1 patrickd patrickd   72192 Aug 20 11:09 clocks_3p1_C.log\n-rw-rw-r--  1 patrickd patrickd     255 Aug 20 11:09 clocks_3p1_C.memguard.log\n-rw-rw-r--  1 patrickd patrickd     854 Aug 20 11:09 clocks_3p1_C.samples\n-rw-rw-r--  1 patrickd patrickd     912 Aug 20 11:06 clocks_3p1_state.txt\n-rw-rw-r--  1 patrickd patrickd    7431 Aug 20 11:10 clocks_ab.log\n=== ab log ===\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T10:59:57-04:00 checkpoint: /home/patrickd/models/ckpt-head-s3\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T10:59:57-04:00 suite sha256: 2b70769e5b034362  blksweep: 6:1:1.5:0,6:1:1.5:1,6:1:1.5:2,6:1:1.5:3,6:1:1.5:4,6:1:1.5:5,6:1:1.5:6,6:1:1.5:7,6:1:1.5:8\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T10:59:57-04:00 === PHASE 0: baseline machine state, stored so it can be put back ===\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T10:59:57-04:00 gpu-gpc-0 is governed (Min=315000000 Max=1386000000) — arm A is a real baseline\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T10:59:57-04:00 stored -> /tmp/clocks_3p1_before.conf  (62 entries)\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T10:59:58-04:00 === ARM A (120W governed — the state every ladder measurement so far was taken in) ===\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T11:03:16-04:00 arm A finished in 196s\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T11:03:16-04:00 arm A OK\n[3.1] arm A       gpc clock over  20 samples: min    315  median    315  max   1386 MHz\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T11:03:16-04:00 === pinning clocks: jetson_clocks at nvpmodel 1 ===\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T11:03:21-04:00 === ARM B (120W pinned — jetson_clocks, gpc floor 1386, EMC 4266) ===\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T11:06:24-04:00 arm B finished in 180s\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T11:06:24-04:00 arm B OK\n[3.1] arm B       gpc clock over  18 samples: min   1386  median   1386  max   1386 MHz\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T11:06:24-04:00 === switching to MAXN and re-pinning ===\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T11:06:35-04:00 === ARM C (MAXN pinned — gpc ceiling 1575, EMC 4266) ===\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T11:09:37-04:00 arm C finished in 180s\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T11:09:37-04:00 arm C OK\n[3.1] arm C       gpc clock over  18 samples: min   1575  median   1575  max   1575 MHz\n[3.1] 2026-08-20T11:09:37